WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.467
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
everybody.

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:05.801
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:08.234
You guys, we are so excited
to be back.

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:09.667
My heart is racing so fast,

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.200
I feel like I took pills
from a Russian figure skater.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.667
[ Laughter and ohs ]
I really do. Ah!

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.801
That's right,
the Beijing Olympics

00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:22.234
are officially over,
but there's still a moment

00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:24.200
that everyone's talking about.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.667
During a race on Saturday,
in especially cold temperatures,

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:31.701
a skier from Finland suffered
a -- well, just listen.

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:33.934
-A cross-country skier
from Finland

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:37.934
experienced frozen penis
while competing.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:38.767
[ Laughter ]
-Oh!

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.834
-What? What?

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:44.501
What?!

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:46.634
[ Rimshot ]

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:48.267
-He used it to his advantage,
though.

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:50.067
For two of the turns,
he didn't even use a ski pole.

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:51.868
-Really?!
-Yeah, it's very
interesting to watch.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:54.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.534
-Thrrr!
-People could tell

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:57.367
[ Laughter ]
something was wrong when he was

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:59.767
doing a handstand under the hand
dryers in the men's room.

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:02.067
Oh, my --
Thank God he's an Olympian

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:03.334
because I wouldn't have
the hand strength.

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:05.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.167
I feel for the guy, though.
He's trained for years

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.901
and now that's what comes up
when you Google him.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.133
You know what I'm saying?
-Aw.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:11.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.534
He went back to the locker room,

00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:13.701
took off his uniform,
and heard --

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:15.267
[ Glass breaking ]
"Alright, here we go.

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:18.634
[ Laughter, ohs, and applause ]
-Oh!
-Just clean that up. Oh!"

00:01:18.634 --> 00:01:21.033
That's right,
the Beijing Olympics are over

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:23.634
and the 2026 Games are in Italy.

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:25.567
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:28.601
Yeah.
That'll be fun.

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:30.367
That'll probably be fun.
When you win a gold there,

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.467
they just kind of palm the medal
during a handshake.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.534
They go, "Here, this is for you.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:36.667
A little something. Come here,
a little something for you."

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:38.300
[ Laughter ]
[ Mumbling ]

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.868
Well, guys, the big story
right now is

00:01:39.868 --> 00:01:42.200
that the U.S. is all
but certain Russia

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.434
is going to invade Ukraine.

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:46.834
[ Boos ]
As we speak, Putin is flipping
a coin like --

00:01:46.834 --> 00:01:48.033
[ As Putin ]
Heads, I invade.

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:49.400
Tails, I invade shirtless.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:53.801
Putin's about as undecided
as when a server asks

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:56.300
if you want a side salad
or fries. You go --

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:01.634
"I think we know
what I'm going to get."

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:02.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:05.300
To avoid war,
French President Emmanuel Macron

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.601
is trying to arrange a sitdown
with Biden and Putin.

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:10.167
Yep, leave it to France
to settle a problem

00:02:10.167 --> 00:02:11.200
with a three-way.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.934
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:18.901
[ Laughter ]
Ukrainian troops have been
standing out there for months,

00:02:18.901 --> 00:02:20.868
waiting for the invasion.
Soldiers are like --

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:22.100
[ Slavic accent ]
We're freezing out here.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.501
And then,
the skier from Finland is like,

00:02:23.501 --> 00:02:24.767
"You don't know what freezing...

00:02:24.767 --> 00:02:26.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.000
...is.
Let's just --

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.167
Let's just be honest.

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:31.968
You have no idea."

00:02:33.367 --> 00:02:35.601
Meanwhile, in other news,
former President Trump

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:39.300
just launched his new social
media app, Truth Social,

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:43.000
[ Booing ]
and it crashed shortly
after launching.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.100
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.734
I mean, I think it crashed.

00:02:48.734 --> 00:02:51.033
I'm not sure. I read it
on the Truth Social app.

00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:52.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.868 --> 00:02:55.968
Some business news --
I saw that Family Dollar had

00:02:55.968 --> 00:02:57.634
to shut down hundreds of stores

00:02:57.634 --> 00:03:01.133
due to a rat infestation
at one of its warehouses.

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:03.133
It's bad.
The rats have already caused

00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:04.634
dollars in damages.

00:03:04.634 --> 00:03:06.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.501 --> 00:03:13.167
And, finally, a man in Florida
was arrested for a DUI

00:03:13.167 --> 00:03:15.200
and is making headlines
for telling officers

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.601
that he was high and happy
when they pulled him over.

00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:19.133
[ Laughter ]
And this is real.

00:03:19.133 --> 00:03:20.467
Can we see a photo of him?

00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:23.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.234 --> 00:03:24.701
He looks like a guy who lives
on the border

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:26.067
between Russia and Ukraine.

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:28.300
[ Laughter ]
Can we see him again?

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.868
Yeah. They found out
the man's identity.

00:03:30.868 --> 00:03:32.467
He's the Olympic skier
from Finland.

00:03:32.467 --> 00:03:33.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Really?
-That's him, yeah.

